Data sources
------------
The license covers this project's source code only. It grants no rights to data that the
pipeline fetches from third parties; each source keeps its own terms:

* SEC EDGAR filings: U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission (public; subject to the SEC's
  fair-access policy, which requires a descriptive User-Agent and rate limits).
* Economic data: U.S. Bureau of Labor Statistics; FRED, Federal Reserve Bank of St. Louis
  (subject to the FRED terms of use); Board of Governors of the Federal Reserve System.
* Inflation nowcasts: Federal Reserve Bank of Cleveland, Inflation Nowcasting
  (doi:10.26509/frbc-inflationnowcast), used for non-commercial research with attribution.
* Market data: Tradier (subject to the Tradier API terms; not redistributed by this project).
* Press releases: syndicated RSS feeds, linked to their publishers, not republished.

Nothing in this project is investment advice. Signals are research output.
